# Caddy reverse proxy for Galene.
#
# Caddy terminates TLS for your hostname (Let's Encrypt certificates are
# obtained automatically) and forwards everything, including the WebSocket
# connection at /ws, to Galene's plain-HTTP listener on localhost.
#
# Replace the hostname below with your own, and point its DNS A/AAAA record
# at this machine before starting the stack.

YOUR-HOSTNAME-HERE {
    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8443
}
